{"id":"d_main_39_07","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch39","label":"Chapter 39 · Gene"},"label":"The Profound","stage":"39-22 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_39_06","next":"d_main_39_08","speakers":{"nayuta_n":"Nayuta","rapi_red":"Rapi","maxwell_p":"Maxwell"},"icons":{"nayuta_n":"si_c9008_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","maxwell_p":"si_c105_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_39_07_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_1","text":"Nayuta only responds to Laplace and Drake's endless barrage of questions with vague remarks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhaleyBack","bgArt":"whaleyback","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_halo","movie":null,"shown":["nayuta_n","rapi_red","maxwell_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_2","text":"Disheartened, the two eventually fall behind and start admiring the scenery.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_3","text":"Taking advantage of the brief calm, I strike up a conversation with Nayuta.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_4","text":"So, Nayuta, how did you end up here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_5","text":"I have not dwelt here long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_6","text":"Whilst meditating atop a mountain, White Giant drew near and sought mine aid. Nay, 'twas Harmonizer aboard it who did so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_7","text":"Raptilion asked you for help? Was there a problem?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_8","text":"There was indeed. And a very great one at that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_9","text":"But it hath been resolved, so fret not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_10","text":"By fate's design, since then I have dwelt upon the White Giant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_11","text":"Truly, the White Giant is extraordinary. It is the sole known case wherein the very entity itself has been altered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_12","text":"Such is the power wrought by the Harmonizer...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_13","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_14","text":"It may be called something that no one hitherto hath touched, a realm far surpassing the bounds of technology, verily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_15","text":"Just now...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_16","text":"When you healed Laplace and Drake's throats back there,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_17","text":"what was that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_18","text":"'Tis but a humble skill. Yet, in the mending and crafting of things, I hold some small measure of expertise, verily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_19","text":"That golden light...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_20","text":"It seemed familiar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_21","text":"Actually, I think I've seen it before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_22","text":"Haha, that cannot be so. Surely, thou art mistaken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_23","text":"No, I've definitely seen it before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_24","text":"Haha. Such a thing is impossible, verily.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_25","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_27","text":"This is no mere jest, I see.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_28","text":"Might I be so bold as to touch thy form, if only for a moment?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_29","text":"Is that all right with you, Commander?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_30","text":"Why are you asking me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_31","text":"No one is allowed to touch my body without your permission.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_32","text":"... Okay. I'll allow it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_33","text":"Very well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_34","text":"Nayuta reaches out and places her hand on Rapi's chest, right where her core is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_35","text":"The golden light from earlier","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_36","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_36","text":"flickers for a brief moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_37","text":"Might I inquire thy name?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_38","text":"Rapi.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_39","text":"Rapi...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_40","text":"May I ask how this came to pass?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_41","text":"What do you mean...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_42","text":"It is the fusion of which I speak.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_43","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_44","text":"I... I'm not entirely sure myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_46","text":"Within thy body doth lie the technology of ours... nay, of theirs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_47","text":"Verily, this is not coexistence alone — it is fusion; a binding as one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_48","text":"You meant to say \"our technology.\" What do you mean by that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_49","text":"What are you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_50","text":"... Pray tell,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_51","text":"Dost thou know of the Profound?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_52","text":"The Profound?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_53","text":"Does the name D.E.E.P. ring a bell, verily?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_54","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_55","text":"Never heard of it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_56","text":"... 'Tis an existence from ages past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_57","text":"It doth possess ancient technologies, and keepeth ancient secrets, so it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_58","text":"Though I may not divulge all the particulars, if I were to speak but simply...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_59","text":"Ere it was scattered to the four winds, the culmination of the craft it so long pursued now resideth within Rapi.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_60","text":"What do you mean... \"the craft it so long pursued\"?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_61","text":"Symbiosis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_62","text":"Verily, it may be said that this is the sole path by which all shall survive without meeting destruction.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_63","text":"What are you talking about? What is D.E.E.P.?  And what's all this about symbiosis and destruction?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_64","text":"Do you know something about my body?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_65","text":"Haha, I beg thy pardon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_66","text":"Yet still can I not fully place my faith in thy strength.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_67","text":"For verily, truth and secret alike do shine forth only when borne by those of true might.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_68","text":"Until I have beheld thy strength, no answer can I grant thee.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_69","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_69","text":"... This may come off as somewhat self-serving,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_70","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_70","text":"but did the Pioneers not tell you anything about us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_71","text":"But of course. Though I have not witnessed it firsthand, I have heard much of the valor displayed by thee and thy squad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_72","text":"Truly, thy deeds are worthy of great praise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_73","text":"Yet, that alone will not suffice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_74","text":"To bear the weight of truth and secrets, one must be born with such a destiny.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_75","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_75","text":"I have no idea what you're saying.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_76","text":"Haha. I would be grateful if thou couldst forget what I have spoken.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_77","text":"For now, it is best we cherish the bond formed upon the White Giant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_39_07_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta_n","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_39_07_78","text":"Now, I shall continue the tour.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}